&lt;h2 id="garden"&gt;Garden&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rural Villa in Ferpicloz&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The house of this &lt;em&gt;villa rustica&lt;/em&gt; was of the winged corridor type (A in Fig. 1) with a porticoed facade (Fig. 1). Attached to the eastern end of the house, measuring 37 x 46 meters, was a wall running east-west which has been interpreted as the protective wall of a garden (G in Fig. 1).&lt;/p&gt;
